msgid "dialogue.gardener.1"
msgstr "I'm Sprout. This little flower is for Uncle Moss."

msgid "dialogue.gardener.2"
msgstr "The rabbit on the left keeps eyeing my carrots. Don't cover for it."

msgid "dialogue.gardener.learn"
msgstr "The wooden crate on the stone plinth is special. Walk up and press E to remember its shape."

msgid "dialogue.gardener.learned"
msgstr "You learned the crate echo? Place one with F and recall it with Q, but mind my seedlings."

msgid "dialogue.keeper.1"
msgstr "Shh, I'm waiting for a fish. The duck arrived first."

msgid "dialogue.keeper.2"
msgstr "The western garden is shady, and the eastern stone bridge leads to the desert."

msgid "dialogue.keeper.3"
msgstr "There is no hurry here. Rest by the water when your feet get tired."

msgid "dialogue.teacher.1"
msgstr "I'm Uncle Moss. I tend this place and help everyone manage their projects."

msgid "dialogue.teacher.2"
msgstr "Place a crate before the platform, jump onto it, then jump onto the stone ledge."

msgid "dialogue.teacher.learn"
msgstr "First visit the crate on the southern stone plinth and press E. Its echo gives you a step onto the platform."

msgid "dialogue.teacher.3"
msgstr "Come to me whenever you need to choose a project or recover an earlier conversation."
